{"t":"SHW","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"The Sherwin-Williams Company","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","employees":64249,"hq":"Cleveland, OH, United States","website":"https://www.sherwin-williams.com","summary_en":"The Sherwin-Williams Company engages in the development, manufacture, distribution, and sale of paint, coatings, and related products to professional, industrial, commercial and retail customers. The company operates through three segments: Paint Stores Group, Consumer Brands Group, and Performance Coatings Group. The Paint Stores Group segment offers architectural paint and coatings; protective and marine products; and OEM product finishes and related products for architectural and industrial paint contractors, and do-it-yourself homeowners under the Sherwin-Williams brand. The Consumer Brands Group segment supplies a portfolio of branded and private-label architectural paints, stains, varnishes, industrial products, wood finishes products, wood preservatives, applicators, corrosion inhibitors, aerosols, caulks, and adhesives to retailers, including home centers and hardware stores, and dedicated dealers and distributors. The Performance Coatings Group segment develops and sells industrial coatings for wood finishing and general industrial applications; automotive refinish products; protective and marine coatings; coil coatings; packaging coatings; and performance-based resins and colorants. This segment serves retailers, dealers, jobbers, licensees, and other third-party distributors. The company operates in North America, South America, the Caribbean, Europe, Asia, and Australia. The Sherwin-Williams Company was founded in 1866 and is headquartered in Cleveland, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Sherwin-Williams Company는 전문가, 산업, 상업 및 소매 고객을 대상으로 페인트, 코팅 및 관련 제품의 개발, 제조, 유통 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 Paint Stores Group, Consumer Brands Group, Performance Coatings Group의 3개 부문으로 운영됩니다. Paint Stores Group 부문은 건축용 페인트 및 코팅을 제공합니다. 보호 및 해양 제품; 건축 및 산업용 페인트 도급업자와 Sherwin-Williams 브랜드의 DIY 주택 소유자를 위한 OEM 제품 마감재 및 관련 제품. 소비자 브랜드 그룹 부문은 홈 센터, 철물점, 전용 딜러 및 유통업체를 포함한 소매업체에 브랜드 및 개인 상표 건축용 페인트, 스테인, 바니시, 산업용 제품, 목재 마감 제품, 목재 방부제, 어플리케이터, 부식 억제제, 에어로졸, 코크 및 접착제 포트폴리오를 공급합니다. Performance Coatings Group 부문은 목재 마감 및 일반 산업용 코팅을 개발 및 판매합니다. 자동차 보수 제품; 보호 및 해양 코팅; 코일 코팅; 포장 코팅; 및 성능 기반 수지 및 착색제. 이 세그먼트는 소매업체, 딜러, 취업자, 라이센스 사용자 및 기타 제3자 유통업체에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 북미, 남미, 카리브해 지역, 유럽, 아시아 및 호주에서 운영됩니다. Sherwin-Williams Company는 1866년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 클리블랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":349.01,"mcap":84316651520.0,"pe":32.107635,"fpe":26.416117,"peg":2.4051,"ps":3.3845663,"pb":21.078028,"ev_ebitda":20.587,"div":0.92,"beta":1.053,"hi52":377.77,"lo52":289.86},"fin":{"rev":24912099328.0,"rev_g":0.079,"eps_g":0.009,"gross":0.48604,"op":0.17563,"net":0.10742,"roe":0.63701,"fcf":2478099968.0,"cash":264200000.0,"debt":14799699968.0,"de":372.16,"eps":10.87,"feps":13.21201},"own":{"short":0.0273,"inst":0.85225,"insider":0.06254},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":374.04166,"median":374.0,"high":420.0,"low":329.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.06897,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":383.0,"priorPriceTarget":392.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":370.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":370.0,"prior